DECISIONS 202, CODEGEN.md §3.3: a field `_1` whose derived Go getter `1` is no Go identifier is refused at the field, once, as an override would be.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A rule.
record Rule {
  /// Its first score.
  _1: Int
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8011]  a/a.canon:6:3
  1, the go name derived for a.Rule._1, is not a valid identifier

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
